#ASSERT `s 2025(j) the date by which the instructional materials are due` 1 EQUALS JUST (Date 18 3 1990)
#ASSERT `s 2025(j) the date by which the instructional materials are due` 2 EQUALS JUST (Date 18 3 1991)
